flowchart TD
  A[Request with trusted inputs] --> B[Authorize namespace]
  B --> C[Derive full compatibility and prompt key]
  C --> D[Open + bounded-parse canonical manifest]
  D --> DA[Resolve catalog key + verify HMAC]
  DA --> DB[Verify namespace, key, generation, fingerprint, prompt root]
  DB --> E[Open immutable object by digest]
  E --> F[Validate header, exact size, canonical metadata]
  F --> G[Verify object/payload/segment digest or AEAD]
  G --> H[Validate required segment policy and prefix chain]
  H --> I[Import into isolated engine context]
  I --> J[Atomic context commit]
  J --> HIT[HIT_VERIFIED]
  B -. any failure .-> MISS[MISS_RECOMPUTE reason]
  C -. any failure .-> MISS
  D -. any failure .-> MISS
  DA -. key or HMAC failure .-> MISS
  DB -. binding failure .-> MISS
  E -. any failure .-> MISS
  F -. any failure .-> MISS
  G -. any failure .-> MISS
  H -. any failure .-> MISS
  I -. reject .-> MISS
  MISS --> K[Discard staged bytes/state]
  K --> L[Quarantine/metric if required]
  L --> R[Trusted prefill recomputation]
